-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\varnothing}\">\\(L_{\\varnothing}\\)</span> (PDA acceptance modes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a4359425e2c64d0a\" href=\"?note=a4359425e2c64d0a\" title=\"73-df-pda-final-state-semantics\">73-df-pda-final-state-semantics</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5bc7edf5698ebdc7\" href=\"?note=5bc7edf5698ebdc7\" title=\"73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics\">73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pda\\text{-}acceptance\\text{-}mode\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall M\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L_F(M)=L_{\\varnothing}(N))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pda\\text{-}acceptance\\text{-}mode\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall M\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L_F(M)=L_{\\varnothing}(N))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pda\\text{-}acceptance\\text{-}mode\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall N\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L_{\\varnothing}(N)=L_F(M))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pda\\text{-}acceptance\\text{-}mode\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall N\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L_{\\varnothing}(N)=L_F(M))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>To pass from final-state to empty-stack acceptance, add a fresh bottom marker and an epsilon-driven drain state reachable from every old final state.</li>\n<li>In the reverse direction, add a fresh bottom marker and enter a fresh final state exactly when that marker is exposed after the input is exhausted.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"5bc7edf5698ebdc7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-final-state-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"a4359425e2c64d0a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-final-state-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-final-state-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"a4359425e2c64d0a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}$, $L_F$, and $L_{\\varnothing}$ (PDA acceptance modes, see [[73-df-pda-final-state-semantics]] and [[73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"5bc7edf5698ebdc7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}$, $L_F$, and $L_{\\varnothing}$ (PDA acceptance modes, see [[73-df-pda-final-state-semantics]] and [[73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"L_F","display":false},{"tex":"L_{\\varnothing}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pda\\text{-}acceptance\\text{-}mode\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall M\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L_F(M)=L_{\\varnothing}(N))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pda\\text{-}acceptance\\text{-}mode\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall N\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_